Subject: [PATCH] retain OpenSolo dialect, heartbeat state and lossless text on modern runtime

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OpenSolo product dialect and retained wire contract]

Keep current upstream runtime/generator while choosing the explicit Solo dialect.
Preserve raw char bytes and assignment semantics, reject non-vehicle heartbeat
cache replacement, support custom dialects without later enum entries, and make
C generator version metadata reproducible. No XML message/enum values change.

